The map of sites draws vector PMTiles files in the Protomaps schema with styles
generated from @protomaps/basemaps 5.7.2 (server/assets/map/protomaps-*.json),
Copyright The Protomaps Authors (https://github.com/protomaps/basemaps), licensed
under the BSD 3-Clause License (licence text next to the files); layers that need
a sprite are left out. The web app bundles MapLibre GL JS (BSD 3-Clause,
Copyright MapLibre contributors), the server reads PMTiles files with pmtiles
(BSD 3-Clause); both are listed in the SBOM with their dependencies.

The tech stack of applications uses data of endoflife.date: the product list
(server/assets/endoflife/products.json, built from the project's product files;
the file names the commit) and the API description (server/assets/endoflife/openapi.yml,
front matter removed, site address filled in), Copyright 2020 endoflife.date
contributors (https://github.com/endoflife-date/endoflife.date), licensed under
the MIT License (licence text next to the files).

The check against common passwords uses a list built from SecLists
(https://github.com/danielmiessler/SecLists, commit dbdbd9ae1135fc53ecb0a9880af94178d0fc6264,
Passwords/Common-Credentials/xato-net-10-million-passwords-1000000.txt, from Mark Burnett's
public-domain "10 million passwords" release): the entries of 12 to 256 characters, in
lower case, sorted and gzip-compressed (server/assets/passwords/common-passwords.txt.gz,
built with scripts/common-passwords.mjs). SecLists is Copyright (c) 2018 Daniel Miessler,
licensed under the MIT License (licence text next to the file).
